ont, <br /><br />C'est un accus\u00e9 de r\u00e9ception de votre entretien avec M. Lafarge, la semaine prochaine \u00e0 10 h 30. <br /> N'h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 me contacter par courriel si vous avez des questions. Je vous prie d'arriver 15 min \u00e0 l'avance lors de votre entretien. <br /><br />Cordialement,<br />\nJeanine Dunna", "time": "45000", "id": 4}]}}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "picture", "value": {"audiosrc": "frn2le08ob02re5aud01", "coverimg": "frn2le08ob02re2img01.jpg", "images": []}}], "id": 2}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Je peux parler de l'heure.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux r\u00e9pondre \u00e0 un courriel en donnant des informations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Je peux parler de travail.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Comment r\u00e9pondez-vous \u00e0 un courriel&nbsp;? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Qu'est-ce que vous \u00e9crivez&nbsp;?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 votre camarade :", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Vous avez un courriel. De qui provient-il&nbsp;?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "STI", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 