level.  ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands key information in written texts about the communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands simple information in slow conversations about the communicative topics and vocabulary related to this level.  ", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Parler de l'heure", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Voici comment vous parlez de l'heure :", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":\"02\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">L'heure</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Exemples</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"5 h - Midi\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">du matin</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Midi - 16 h\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> de l'apr\u00e8s-midi </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"16 h - Minuit\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">du soir</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "R\u00e9pondre \u00e0 un courriel", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Voici la structure d'un courriel quand vous souhaitez y r\u00e9pondre :", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Vous commencez par une introduction qui dit que vous y r\u00e9pondez. <br />Ensuite, vous confirmez ou rectifiez l'information.<br />Puis, vous demandez \u00e0 la personne qui re\u00e7oit le courriel si tout est correct et vous lui donnez la possibilit\u00e9 de vous contacter pour de plus amples informations. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Exemples : <br /><span class=\"italic\"><br/>Cher M. Dupont, <br /><br /> Ce courriel est en r\u00e9ponse \u00e0 votre demande.<br /><br />  Je confirme l'entretien \u00e0 10 heures du matin.<br /><br />  N'h\u00e9sitez pas \u00e0 me contacter si vous avez des questions. Je vous prie d'arriver 15 minutes en avance.<br /><br />  Bien \u00e0 vous,<br /> Jeanine Dunas</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "convoquer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "demander \u00e0 une personne de venir \u00e0 un endroit pr\u00e9cis", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il a \u00e9t\u00e9 convoqu\u00e9 au bureau du directeur.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " Voici des mots que vous utilisez lors d'un entretien", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "\u00eatre disponible", "type": "name"}, {"content": "avoir du temps libre", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je suis disponible samedi pour garder le b\u00e9b\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "confirmer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "demander \u00e0 une personne de pr\u00e9ciser si cette personne sera pr\u00e9sente", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je vous prie de confirmer votre participation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "attendre avec impatience", "type": "name"}, {"content": "penser de fa\u00e7on positive \u00e0 quelque chose qui va arriver dans le futur", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : J'attends avec impatience ta visite.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'opportunit\u00e9", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une chance de faire quelque chose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Merci pour cette opportunit\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "en r\u00e9ponse \u00e0 ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "quelque chose que vous dites ou faites a une r\u00e9action directe sur quelque chose d'autre", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Ce courriel est en r\u00e9ponse \u00e0 votre lettre.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "frn2le08ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'agence d'int\u00e9rim", "type": "name"}, {"content": "une agence qui place les employ\u00e9s dans les entreprises temporairement", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : L'agence d'int\u00e9rim vient de me contacter pour un emploi.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn2le08ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Vous recevez un courriel qui vous demande de venir pour passer un entretien \u00e0 4 heures demain.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "R\u00e9pondez \u00e0 ce courriel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Demandez \u00e0 venir \u00e0 une heure diff\u00e9rente.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez votre courriel \u00e0 voix haute.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "Je r\u00e9ponds a un courriel.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9cris sur les jours et l'heure.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "J'\u00e9cris au sujet du travail.", "type": "text"}]}]}